  // standard values; tarkov.dev still serves the old per-quest value for these
  // tasks in every mode. All entries are CONVERGED (base overrides): where the
  // wiki already documents the new figure it is the regular witness, and where
  // it still shows the old figure it is treated as stale because the 1.1 patch
  // notes apply the rework to all game modes and the 1.1-pve data carries
  // single mode-free values (see the SOURCES OF TRUTH header).
  //
  // Perfect Mediator - REMOVED on main: superseded by the Season 1
  // trader-loyalty rework; see git history (commit 045c943).
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

